; glows.xon -- the light a ring casts worn, by its guise: (glow GUISE R
; G B), a little light just round the player, pulsing (see
; roguelike/frame.x).  A guise named nowhere glows a pale lilac.  By
; guise, not by kind, so a ring not yet known shows only what it looks
; like.  The dale's rings are plain stuff, and their light is odd for
; it.

(glow "tin" 80 150 255)
(glow "horn" 255 70 50)
(glow "bone" 190 80 230)
(glow "silver" 110 140 255)
